OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Flate sunshine, then a dry evening and
OL,7,Fovernight period with often clear
OL,8,Fskies. Perhaps turning a little misty
OL,9,Fby dawn in some rural spots. A much
OL,10,Fcooler night and becoming chilly in
OL,11,Fthe countryside with localised grass
OL,12,Ffrost.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FAny mist patches quickly
OL,15,Fclearing to leave a fine day with
OL,16,Flight winds and prolonged periods of
OL,17,Fwarm sunshine, although western
OL,18,Fcounties like Shropshire and
OL,19,FHerefordshire may remain cloudier.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
