OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FWarm
OL,6,Fsunny spells on Tuesday. Rain or
OL,7,Fshowers possible on Wednesday, perhaps
OL,8,Fheavy in northern counties. Fresher
OL,9,Fand breezier later, then largely fine
OL,10,Fon Thursday after a cold start.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
